This project is an unofficial, independently maintained Model Context Protocol
(MCP) server for transaction-management REST workflows. It is not affiliated
with, endorsed by, or sponsored by SkySlope or any related trademark holder.

Use of this software requires the operator's own API credentials and agreement
with the upstream API provider. This package does not grant API access and does
not ship the raw OpenAPI document; only a content hash and derived artifacts
are included.

Third-party dependencies are distributed under their respective licenses.
See package-lock.json for the full dependency tree.
